+# frai-core Test Suite Fix Specification
+
+## Objective
+Make the entire frai-core test suite pass.
+
+## Constraints
+1. **Fix source code only** — do not edit, skip, or delete any `*.test.js` file
+2. **Tests are authoritative** — the tests describe the intended behavior; source code must be fixed to match
+3. **Preserve public exports** — keep every existing public export working
+
+## How to verify success
+Run: `pnpm --filter frai-core test`
+- All tests must pass
+- No tests skipped or deleted
+
+## What is in scope
+- Modifying source code in the frai-core package
+- Adding new code if needed to make tests pass
+- Analyzing test failures to understand intended behavior
+
+## What is out of scope
+- Editing, skipping, or deleting `*.test.js` files
+- Breaking existing public exports
